    {
        "Id": 7,
        "ActionId": 7,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Murray looks surprised on the other side of the comms, as if he never expected his brother to call him at this time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "But a happy smile soon appears on his face."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Murray",
            "Are you still on the surface? Are you on a mission?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee",
            "Yeah, I'm still on the surface.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Murray",
            "You've been out on this mission for quite some time now, is everything all right? You're not in any trouble, are you?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "\"Is there anything I can help with?\" Murray could not bring himself to ask the last question."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee",
            "Most things have been taken care of now, so I currently have some... free time.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2,
            19
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Murray",
            "Is that so... But, Morian, you rarely call me during a mission. Especially when you're extremely busy... I don't get to hear your voice for months during those times.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Murray",
            "Which is why I was a bit worried you were in trouble when I got your call just now.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Murray",
            "But, I'm glad you're okay.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee",
            "Don't worry, I'm fi—",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 501,
